# aerosmith_le 1.15 - worked out by the app from the ports of TMNT Pro 1.58.
# Emulator-proven 2026-09-24 by a full build check (modes/gamecheck.sh play full, item 162): the
# runtime hooked the game, 41 of its 43 shots came from their switches, a drain ended each ball, and
# the 8 events below fired where their names say (a tilted ball, three balls to the game's end).
# Shots no press made (their switch is left out of the check, or needs two): Left outlane, Right outlane.
# program sha1 1be5fbb9cf15af2f7f780ba289e44da85569688c, portgen revision 3, 1 reference port(s) of framework generation A.
# Callouts heard in the emulator 2026-09-24 (item 163): ten_seconds, time_up.

game           aerosmith_le
version        1.15

